  "notes": "The portable C++ and Java scenarios use only their official IEEE 1516.1-2025 RTIambassador and FederateAmbassador APIs plus language-standard libraries. Provider library, FOM, endpoint, callback model, and logical-time implementation are adapter inputs. They combine ordinary receive-order Send/Receive Interaction with timestamped Send/Receive Interaction, asynchronous delivery, and Time Advance Request/Grant. No provider headers, registries, or runtime state are accessed by either scenario.",
